sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-b0[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Artifacts → Files sub-tab: browse the artifact-file store[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The ACE Artifacts tab gains a sixth \"Files\" sub-tab that makes [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]every indexed artifact file browsable by kind, project, agent, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]origin, and time — with the same marks, copy mode, references, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]filters, and jump machinery as its sibling panes — and puts each [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]file one keypress from the preview reader or the rich terminal [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]viewer, so the 4,000-file store stops being reachable only through [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the one agent run that produced each file.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifacts_files_subtab.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-b0[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-b0/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Register the Files sub-tab across TUI plumbing[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scaffold[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scaffold: register `files` in the shared Artifacts sub-tab constants, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compose a real-but-empty ArtifactsFilesPane on digit 6, and wire [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]actions, gating, keymaps, copy-mode routing safety, marks state, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placeholder/onboarding/help/palette surfaces, and styles.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Files list, kind icons, and off-thread loading[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FF